sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    C->>API: 1. POST /presign filename=1.jpg(帶 Token)
    API-->>C: { presigned_url, s3_key }
    C->>S3: 2. PUT 圖片內容 (直傳 S3)
    S3-->>C: 200 OK
    C->>API: 3. GET /location-directory?lat=...&lng=... (選配)
    API-->>C: 私人景點 + 全站景點候選
    C->>API: 4. POST /photos { s3_key, caption, user_location_id | global_location_id }
    API->>DB: 寫入 photos Table
    API-->>C: Photo Created
